     1 				; Current font name and size, for the status line, the Character > font messages and the font prompt.
     2 				; Size = the paragraph's width step in pixels (PWt in scale.inc, 5 px when it has no width mark).
     3 = BFE0			fv1 = $BFE0                    ; font slot of the paragraph at the cursor
     4 = BFE1			fv2 = $BFE1                    ; its width step 0..5
     5 = BFE2			fv3 = $BFE2                    ; loop counter
     6
     7 				; append "Name Npx" for the paragraph at the cursor to BUF
